    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d949">

                <pb facs="1534" n="1506" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v03/pg1506"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.5611/7–654: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Deputy United States Representative at the United
                        Nations</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wadsworth</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Department of State
                    </hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1954-07-06">July 6, 1954</date>.<lb/>Received
                        11: 36 p.m.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>10. Reference Marshallese petition. US trusteeship delegation was today shown by
                        UN Secretariat copy of draft resolution
                    submitted by USSR on Marshallese petition and
                    given informal translation of Russian text. Main points as follows: <pb
                        facs="1535" n="1507" xml:id="pg1507"/>
                    <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Preamble declares H-bomb
                            experiments in trust territory inconsistent with UN charter, especially Article 83 (2), and with trusteeship
                            agreement and US obligations under trusteeship system.</p>
                        <p>Operative paragraphs recommend that: <list>
                                <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>)</label>
                                <item>US stop tests in trust territory.</item>
                                <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>)</label>
                                <item>Provide full compensation to those affected by recent
                                    tests.</item>
                                <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>)</label>
                                <item>Restore full rights of inhabitants to all land used for
                                    tests.</item>
                            </list></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>Resolution will be circulated tomorrow morning as document TC/.2/L.101.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Wadsworth</hi>
                    </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
